{"verse_key": "10:39", "surah": 10, "verse": 39, "text_uthmani": "بَلْ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِمَا لَمْ يُحِيطُوا۟ بِعِلْمِهِۦ وَلَمَّا يَأْتِهِمْ تَأْوِيلُهُۥ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۖ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "Rather, they have denied that which they encompass not in knowledge and whose interpretation has not yet come to them. Thus did those before them deny. Then observe how was the end of the wrongdoers.", "verse_from_ms": 978790, "verse_to_ms": 999710, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "بَلْ", "start_ms": 978790, "end_ms": 979460}, {"i": 1, "text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "start_ms": 979460, "end_ms": 980520}, {"i": 2, "text": "بِمَا", "start_ms": 980520, "end_ms": 981160}, {"i": 3, "text": "لَمْ", "start_ms": 981160, "end_ms": 981490}, {"i": 4, "text": "يُحِيطُوا۟", "start_ms": 981490, "end_ms": 982600}, {"i": 5, "text": "بِعِلْمِهِۦ", "start_ms": 982600, "end_ms": 983700}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَلَمَّا", "start_ms": 983700, "end_ms": 985190}, {"i": 7, "text": "يَأْتِهِمْ", "start_ms": 985190, "end_ms": 986200}, {"i": 8, "text": "تَأْوِيلُهُۥ", "start_ms": 986200, "end_ms": 987910}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 987910, "end_ms": 988870}, {"i": 10, "text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "start_ms": 988870, "end_ms": 989640}, {"i": 11, "text": "كَذَّبَ", "start_ms": 989640, "end_ms": 990670}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 990670, "end_ms": 991720}, {"i": 13, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 991720, "end_ms": 992720}, {"i": 14, "text": "قَبْلِهِمْ", "start_ms": 992720, "end_ms": 994020}, {"i": 15, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 994020, "end_ms": 994710}, {"i": 16, "text": "فَٱنظُرْ", "start_ms": 994710, "end_ms": 995230}, {"i": 17, "text": "كَيْفَ", "start_ms": 995230, "end_ms": 996270}, {"i": 18, "text": "كَانَ", "start_ms": 996270, "end_ms": 999065}, {"i": 19, "text": "عَـٰقِبَةُ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 20, "text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "start_